&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;At Alpine Eagle, we’re building the future of counter-drone defence. We’re a fast-growing, international deep-tech company working at the intersection of aerospace engineering, defence systems, and machine learning. Our goal: create the world’s first swarm-based, airborne counter-drone system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;592&quot;&gt;Modern conflicts show how quickly drones are reshaping the battlefield. Threats are rising, and today’s solutions aren’t keeping pace. We’re here to change that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;781&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;Alpine Eagle isn’t just a defence company. It’s a mission. Backed by an international team, strong funding, and a bold vision, we’re looking for people who want to shape the next generation of aerial security and build something that truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;🎯How you will make an impact:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive end-to-end recruitment for technical roles, with a particular focus on software engineering, AI/ML, robotics, and other deep-tech positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify, approach, and engage talent through LinkedIn, referrals, networking, and direct search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain talent pipelines for current and future hiring needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct initial candidate outreach, screening interviews, and manage candidates throughout the hiring process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate interviews and ensure a positive candidate experience from first contact to offer stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hiring managers with candidate sourcing, market insights, and recruiting best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help strengthen Alpine Eagle&#39;s employer brand within the engineering, defense-tech, and startup communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate recruiting data and contribute to efficient hiring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of recruiting experience, either in-house or agency-side&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing and recruiting technical talent, particularly Software Engineers, AI/ML Engineers, Embedded Engineers, or comparable profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong direct-sourcing and candidate engagement skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand technical skill sets and assess candidate fit at an initial screening level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience recruiting within defense, aerospace, national security, or other highly regulated industries is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Alpine Eagle, you&#39;re not just taking a job - you&#39;re joining a mission.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
